## Critical Success Metrics

### Research Validity
| Metric | Target | Why It Matters |
|--------|--------|----------------|
| MMLU improvement (PAKD vs baseline) | >5% | Proves PAKD effectiveness |
| Profile-specific accuracy | >8% variance | Shows adaptation works |
| Statistical significance | p < 0.05 | Ensures not random chance |
| Reproducibility | 3+ successful runs | Confirms stability |

### Resource Efficiency  
| Metric | Target | Why It Matters |
|--------|--------|----------------|
| Model size | <512MB | Core claim verification |
| Tokens/sec (CPU) | >30 | Usability threshold |
| RAM usage | <512MB peak | Low-end device capability |
| Works on Raspberry Pi | Yes | Concrete proof |

### Community Validation
| Metric | Target | Why It Matters |
|--------|--------|----------------|
| Beta testers | 15-20 | Credible sample size |
| User satisfaction | >4.0 / 5.0 | Quality validation |
| GitHub stars | >50 | Interest indicator |
| Demo visitors | >200 | Reach demonstration |

